    "detailed_description": "A Breakout style arcade game where you get to collect hearts for bonus points and extra lives while destroying the bricks.<br>Unlock cool power ups and not so cool power downs as you progress through the game.<br><br><br>Features:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play it with your keyboard, the mouse or a gamepad (recommended).<br></li><li>100 levels to play.<br></li><li>14 power ups / power downs to unlock.<br></li><li>Initially slow and easy, then gradually more challenging.<br></li><li>All the power ups and power downs you unlock will remain unlocked when you start a new game.<br></li><li>The ball's speed is slightly increased each time it bounces off a destructible brick.</li></ul>",
